invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the webpki ch_connect never writes ch_tls.ticket_config_hash, so the
  tickets a session receives are bound to an all-zero hash and none
  resumes the configuration that received it. The received-ticket
  rows object.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(cfg, t->ticket_config_hash);
    // psk_ok matters only to a CA build
--- new
    // psk_ok matters only to a CA build
